### 1. Work on saikat branch

git checkout saikat

### 2. Commit and push changes

git add .
git commit -m "message"
git push origin saikat

### 3. Merge into main and push

git checkout main
git merge saikat
git push origin main

### 4. Update fork with upstream changes

git checkout main
git fetch upstream
git merge upstream/main
git push origin main
